# Add this site only if jonathan.quest is not already configured. Otherwise,
# import the fragment into its existing site and preserve its other handlers.
# This is an ADDITION to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile, never a replacement for it.
jonathan.quest {
	import /etc/caddy/aiab-introspection.caddy

	# Keep the current apex fallback here, if one exists. An existing unconditional
	# respond/rewrite/reverse_proxy should live in a fallback handle { ... } block
	# so that it does not preempt the more specific application handles.
}

# Preserve the existing files.jonathan.quest service and its authentication.
# Apply the separate sensitive-file guard documented in HOSTING.md.
